; Serial-host agent library for the Host_link serial interface (serial_host_pilot.md).
;
; Items, configuration, driver, passive monitor and agent for the host side of the P3.5
; serial link. There are no inline_tests, so endpoint, system and package suites can
; depend on it without linking another suite's tests; its tests live in the HL4a suite in
; the parent directory. The driver and monitor work on logical pins as booleans, so
; nothing here needs Hardcaml; the suite's adapter maps them to the DUT's ports.

(library
 (name electrum_serial_host_agent)
 (modules item config driver monitor agent)
 (libraries core host_link_protocol)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_jane))
 (lint
  (pps ppx_js_style))
 (flags
  (:standard -w -27-57-33-34-35-40-63-47-26)))
